WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:04.240
The realm must not perish at my hands.

00:06.240 --> 00:07.640
Retreat to Tianhe.

00:10.840 --> 00:12.280
As Your Majesty commands.

00:13.040 --> 00:17.920
Autumn of the 26th year of Longwu under the strong pressure of Shilang's army.

00:18.160 --> 00:21.800
Xuan Kingdom had to abandon Beiyu Pass and other lands north of the river.

00:21.880 --> 00:25.440
And retreated to defend Tianhe, relying on the navy.

00:26.120 --> 00:31.520
Shilang fought at Tianhe for half a year but could never advance a single step.

00:31.760 --> 00:34.240
Finally had to retreat north.

00:35.040 --> 00:38.360
Xuan Kingdom also suffered heavy losses in this battle.

00:39.240 --> 00:44.400
The loss of Beiyu Pass signaled that Xuan Kingdom had no hope of northern expeditions signaled that Xuan Kingdom had no hope of northern expeditions.

